License: catalog-data
 The website category lists shipped under /usr/share/walden/catalog are
 generated by walden-list from upstream community lists. They are not
 covered by Walden's GPL-3.0-or-later license.
 .
 fake-news, gambling, and social-media use category sources described by
 StevenBlack/hosts as MIT-licensed. porn and porn-extended contain data
 from Bon-Appetit/porn-domains and are distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
 ads-malware combines upstream datasets under several licenses.
 .
 See https://github.com/eliascotto/walden-list/blob/main/LICENSE-DATA.md
 and the installed catalog manifest for per-source attribution. If an
 upstream license conflicts with this summary, the upstream license
 controls.
